Host-side runtime. Model-agnostic by construction, not by convention.

These files were in model-families/common, which is how a transport, a
tokenizer, a KV store and a kernel library came to share a directory and a fate:
deleting the library for being redundant took the other thirteen with it, and no
gate noticed because none compiled the tree that used them.

  transport/   hidden state between pipeline ranks, TP collectives, memlink
  kv/          KV block store and its client
  text/        tokenizer
  workspace.h  pool layout for the grouped GEMM
  launch.h     launch planning, arithmetic only, host-testable
  gemm.cuh     the four CUDA calls a GEMM needs
  tensor_map.h cuTensorMapEncodeTiled

Nothing here knows which model is running. Anything that would have to belongs
in llms/<model>/.
